                        "form": "flagorneries"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f3c14d1c-e497-35b0-8129-9255d60ae346",
                        "entry_id": "b3ed214f-1d5b-3bd6-b395-c2e0f00bb81d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Flatterie grossière."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8b7294b-d050-4631-b5ec-4647c8110e05",
                                "sense_id": "f3c14d1c-e497-35b0-8129-9255d60ae346",
                                "text": "Les flagorneries dédicatoires des écrivains louis-quatorziens aplatis sur les marches du trône paraissent aujourd'hui si délirantes, que nous nous interrogeons sur leur sincérité, voire leur lucidité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcffa7f6-1cd6-4291-88e4-92c4c4e92066",
                                "sense_id": "f3c14d1c-e497-35b0-8129-9255d60ae346",
                                "text": "Flagorneries ! Foutaises ! Bon à rien ! Ectoplasme ! Quenouille !"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                        "entry_id": "b3ed214f-1d5b-3bd6-b395-c2e0f00bb81d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Flatterie servile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "074ee6b2-5d6a-43fa-896b-e01064b3a54e",
                                "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                                "text": "La prière, c’est l'élévation de notre âme vers Dieu. […]. C’est une sorte de tapage doublé de flagornerie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "626260bf-b090-4e31-9eda-8aaeaf333e1d",
                                "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                                "text": "Tant de flagorneries lui ont été prodiguées qu’il a fini par s’en griser."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9094f80f-bf2a-476b-a18d-f1f1ca662a15",
                                "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                                "text": "La propagande concernant des succès — réels ou imaginaires — prévalait sur tout et l’on encourageait la flagornerie et la servilité ;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75aa8219-49d7-4a72-b263-0cc16ca2ad55",
                                "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                                "text": "Talleyrand était à la flagornerie ce que Vatel était à la queue, c'est-à-dire un maître. — (Pierre Desproges)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4978ccb3-3e11-45a2-bb9d-5d51b91c9f67",
                                "sense_id": "30f80125-b36e-3bdc-bf39-27e44623f67a",
                                "text": "Mais que dire des flagorneries dithyrambiques qui encensent les riches, dont on se garde bien de dévoiler l'origine de la fortune ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae7a0418-6228-41e1-9b24-50c1094e62c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "b3ed214f-1d5b-3bd6-b395-c2e0f00bb81d",
                        "target_lang_word": "sycophancy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sycophancy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00cf63ff-00fb-3c61-aa96-90ca4f70f137",
                                        "entry_id": "092637ec-e866-3bb5-b04b-b5acf27c7214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fawning behavior of a sycophant; servile flattery; fawningness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc5151ec-24ad-440f-a15e-6942f21cac37",
                                                "sense_id": "00cf63ff-00fb-3c61-aa96-90ca4f70f137",
                                                "text": "I have always been taken aback at the high number of people in whom an astonishingly high income led to additional sycophancy as they became more dependent on their clients and employers and more addicted to making even more money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1b7da95-4b39-4236-a8f2-6efb20664a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "00cf63ff-00fb-3c61-aa96-90ca4f70f137",
                                                "text": "“I don’t want to get myself into trouble,” he added, “but she’s very, she’s a great woman.”\nVictoria [Starmer] looked a little creeped out. Her husband might be a master Trump-wrangler, an expert at sycophancy and genuflection, but she wasn’t."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4c4ebd6-99b1-342d-901a-c60a753466b2",
                                        "entry_id": "092637ec-e866-3bb5-b04b-b5acf27c7214",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The tendency of a language model to produce answers that flatter or agree with a user’s beliefs or biases rather than giving accurate or truthful information, or to give strategically false answers when it infers that it is being evaluated in terms of alignment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
